#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2
msgid "Release Notes"
msgstr "发布说明"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:4
msgid ""
"The release notes are also available in the `Isaac Lab GitHub repository "
"<https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab/releases>`_. The entries below "
"reproduce the published release text in reStructuredText format, excluding "
"externally hosted media."
msgstr ""
"发布说明也可在 `Isaac Lab GitHub 仓库 <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/releases>`_ 查看。以下以 reStructuredText 格式收录已发布的说明，不包含外部托管的媒体。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:9
msgid "v3.0.0-beta2.patch1"
msgstr "v3.0.0-beta2.patch1"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:11
msgid ""
"`View this release on GitHub <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/releases/tag/v3.0.0-beta2.patch1>`__."
msgstr ""
"`在 GitHub 查看此版本 <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/releases/tag/v3.0.0-beta2.patch1>`__ 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:13
msgid ""
"This is a small patch release on top of the previous Isaac Lab 3.0.0 Beta 2 "
"release, including an update to support Isaac Sim 6.0.1, which includes "
"fixes and improvements for NuRec workflows. See the `Isaac Sim 6.0.1 release"
" notes "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/6.0.1/overview/release_notes.html>`_."
" Additionally, some fixes were introduced for Isaac Lab dependencies and "
"docker image to better support compatibility with Isaac Sim."
msgstr ""
"这是基于 Isaac Lab 3.0.0 Beta 2 的小型补丁版本，新增对 Isaac Sim 6.0.1 的支持，其中包含 NuRec "
"工作流的修复和改进，见 `Isaac Sim 6.0.1 发布说明 "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/6.0.1/overview/release_notes.html>`_"
" 。此外，修复了部分 Isaac Lab 依赖和 Docker 镜像问题，改善与 Isaac Sim 的兼容性。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:20 source/refs/release_notes.rst:528
#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:845 source/refs/release_notes.rst:874
msgid "What's Changed"
msgstr "变更内容"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:22
msgid ""
"Bump h5py version to ``>=3.16.0`` by @peterd-NV in `PR #6266 "
"<https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab/pull/6266>`_."
msgstr ""
"将 h5py 版本提高到 ``>=3.16.0`` ，由 @peterd-NV 在 `PR #6266 "
"<https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab/pull/6266>`_ 提交。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:24
msgid ""
"Updates Isaac Sim to version 6.0.1 by @kellyguo11 in `PR #6277 "
"<https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab/pull/6277>`_."
msgstr ""
"将 Isaac Sim 更新到 6.0.1，由 @kellyguo11 在 `PR #6277 <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/pull/6277>`_ 提交。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:26
msgid ""
"[Fix] Cherry-pick Isaac Sim 6.0 streaming crash fix by @hujc7 in `PR #6295 "
"<https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab/pull/6295>`_."
msgstr ""
"[修复] 引入 Isaac Sim 6.0 串流崩溃修复，由 @hujc7 在 `PR #6295 <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/pull/6295>`_ 提交。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:29
msgid ""
"`Full Changelog <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/compare/v3.0.0-beta2...v3.0.0-beta2.patch1>`_."
msgstr ""
"`完整变更日志 <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/compare/v3.0.0-beta2...v3.0.0-beta2.patch1>`_ 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:32
msgid "v3.0.0-beta2"
msgstr "v3.0.0-beta2"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:34
msgid ""
"`View this release on GitHub <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/releases/tag/v3.0.0-beta2>`__."
msgstr ""
"`在 GitHub 查看此版本 <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/releases/tag/v3.0.0-beta2>`__ 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:36
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab 3.0 Beta 2 is a stabilization and enablement release for the Isaac"
" Lab 3.0 beta development. It builds on `v3.0.0-beta "
"<https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab/releases/tag/v3.0.0-beta>`_ with "
"additional features and improvements on Newton support (VBD, solver "
"coupling, Kamino, rough terrain, sensors), multi-backend physics, simplified"
" training and installation commands, kit-less workflows, visualizers, "
"rendering, teleoperation, learning exports, installation, CI, and "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 3.0 Beta 2 以稳定和扩展 3.0 测试版功能为重点。在 `v3.0.0-beta "
"<https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab/releases/tag/v3.0.0-beta>`_ 基础上，新增并改进"
" Newton 支持（VBD、求解器耦合、Kamino、崎岖地形、传感器）、多后端物理、简化的训练和安装命令，以及不依赖 Kit "
"的工作流、可视化器、渲染、遥操作、学习模型导出、安装、CI 和文档。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:42
msgid ""
"This release is compatible with the latest release of `Isaac Sim 6.0 "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/6.0.0/installation/download.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"此版本兼容最新发布的 `Isaac Sim 6.0 "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/6.0.0/installation/download.html>`_"
" 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:47
msgid ""
"This is a beta release. The ``develop`` branch is still under active "
"development and may continue to receive breaking changes, error-message "
"changes, or performance tuning before the final 3.0 release. Please check "
"out the ``develop`` branch for the latest development updates."
msgstr ""
"这是测试版本。 ``develop`` 分支仍在积极开发，在最终 3.0 发布前，可能继续出现不兼容变化、错误提示变化或性能调优。最新开发进展请查看 "
"``develop`` 分支。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:52 source/refs/release_notes.rst:310
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "主要亮点"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:55
msgid "Multi-Backend Stabilization"
msgstr "多后端稳定性改进"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:57
msgid ""
"The multi-backend architecture introduced in the first 3.0 beta has been "
"hardened across PhysX, Newton, OVPhysX, Isaac RTX, OVRTX, and kit-less "
"execution paths. This release improves backend selection, scene-data "
"routing, clone-plan handling, sensor reset behavior, runtime compatibility "
"checks, and error reporting when unsupported physics, renderer, or "
"visualizer combinations are requested."
msgstr ""
"首个 3.0 测试版引入的多后端架构，在 PhysX、Newton、OVPhysX、Isaac RTX、OVRTX 及无 Kit "
"执行路径上进一步完善。改进了后端选择、场景数据路由、克隆计划处理、传感器重置行为、运行时兼容性检查，以及请求不支持的物理、渲染器、可视化器组合时的错误报告。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:63
msgid "Newton Physics & Kit-Less Workflows"
msgstr "Newton 物理与无 Kit 工作流"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:65
msgid ""
"Newton and OVPhysX support have been expanded and stabilized for larger kit-"
"less training and visualization workflows:"
msgstr "扩展并稳定 Newton 和 OVPhysX 支持，以适应更大规模的无 Kit 训练及可视化工作流："

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:68
msgid ""
"Adds Newton ray-caster, frame-transformer, IMU/PVA, contact, joint-wrench, "
"deformable, and VBD-coupling support across the relevant packages."
msgstr "在相关包中增加 Newton 射线投射器、坐标变换器、IMU/PVA、接触、关节力旋量、可变形物体及 VBD 耦合支持。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:70
msgid ""
"Adds Newton rough-terrain locomotion presets for quadrupeds and bipeds, plus"
" additional MJWarp presets for manipulation, navigation, and Spot "
"environments."
msgstr "为四足和双足机器人增加 Newton 崎岖地形运动预设，并为操作、导航及 Spot 环境补充 MJWarp 预设。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:72
msgid ""
"Adds documentation for Newton installation, supported features, MJWarp, "
"Kamino, VBD, solver comparison, Warp environment migration, and the Newton "
"manager abstraction."
msgstr "补充 Newton 安装、支持功能、MJWarp、Kamino、VBD、求解器对比、Warp 环境迁移和 Newton 管理器抽象的文档。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:74
msgid ""
"Fixes heterogeneous replication, clone-plan source resolution, stale sensor "
"data after resets, Newton visualizer updates on PhysX simulations, and "
"Newton camera/site frame poses."
msgstr ""
"修复异构复制、克隆计划源解析、重置后的传感器旧数据、PhysX 仿真中的 Newton 可视化器更新，以及 Newton 相机/site 坐标系位姿。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:76
msgid ""
"Adds initial experimental support for OvPhysX (kit-less version of PhysX)."
msgstr "增加对 OvPhysX（无 Kit 版本的 PhysX）的初步实验性支持。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:79
msgid "Rendering, Cameras & PPISP"
msgstr "渲染、相机与 PPISP"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:81
msgid ""
"Rendering received broad updates across Isaac RTX, OVRTX, and Newton Warp:"
msgstr "Isaac RTX、OVRTX 和 Newton Warp 的渲染功能均有广泛更新："

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:83
msgid ""
"Adds ``isaaclab_ppisp``, a renderer-backend-agnostic physically plausible "
"image signal processing pipeline for converting HDR scene-linear output to "
"LDR camera images."
msgstr ""
"新增 ``isaaclab_ppisp`` ，提供与渲染后端无关、符合物理规律的图像信号处理流水线，将 HDR 场景线性输出转换为 LDR 相机图像。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:85
msgid ""
"Adds HDR render outputs and internal PPISP composition to Isaac RTX, OVRTX, "
"and Newton Warp renderers when ``CameraCfg.isp_cfg`` is configured."
msgstr ""
"配置 ``CameraCfg.isp_cfg`` 时，Isaac RTX、OVRTX 和 Newton Warp 渲染器支持 HDR 输出及内部 "
"PPISP 处理。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:87
msgid ""
"Moves the tiled-camera implementation into ``Camera`` and improves tiled-"
"camera support in Kit and Newton visualizers."
msgstr "将平铺相机实现并入 ``Camera`` ，改善 Kit 和 Newton 可视化器中的平铺相机支持。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:89
msgid ""
"Fixes OVRTX multi-GPU operation, cloned-environment camera output, temp-file"
" handling, missing-runtime errors, and package resolution for optional PPISP"
" installs."
msgstr "修复 OVRTX 多 GPU 运行、克隆环境相机输出、临时文件处理、运行时缺失错误，以及可选 PPISP 安装的包解析。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:91
msgid ""
"Adds rendering correctness, image comparison, visualizer integration, and "
"performance tests."
msgstr "增加渲染正确性、图像对比、可视化器集成及性能测试。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:94
msgid "Visualizers & Scene Data"
msgstr "可视化器与场景数据"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:96
msgid ""
"The visualizer system now has stronger backend-agnostic scene-data support:"
msgstr "可视化器系统增强了与后端无关的场景数据支持："

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:98
msgid "Adds a scene-data backend hook for active ``InteractiveScene`` access."
msgstr "增加用于访问当前 ``InteractiveScene`` 的场景数据后端钩子。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:99
msgid ""
"Improves scene-data providers for PhysX, Newton, and OVPhysX so visualizers "
"can discover transforms, contacts, and sensors consistently."
msgstr "改进 PhysX、Newton 和 OVPhysX 场景数据提供器，让可视化器能一致地发现变换、接触及传感器。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:101
msgid "Adds tiled camera views to Kit and Newton visualizers."
msgstr "为 Kit 和 Newton 可视化器增加平铺相机视图。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:102
msgid ""
"Fixes visualizer startup ordering, Kit visualizer crashes, Newton visualizer"
" updates on PhysX scenes, and camera/video recording behavior when multiple "
"visualizers are active."
msgstr ""
"修复可视化器启动顺序、Kit 可视化器崩溃、PhysX 场景中的 Newton 可视化器更新，以及同时启用多个可视化器时的相机和视频录制行为。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:106
msgid "Teleoperation, Mimic & Policy Deployment"
msgstr "遥操作、Mimic 与策略部署"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:108
msgid ""
"Teleoperation and imitation-learning workflows were updated for the 3.0 "
"stack:"
msgstr "遥操作及模仿学习工作流已按 3.0 的组件更新："

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:110
msgid ""
"Adds Isaac Capture MCAP record/replay support and a non-interactive "
"``teleop_replay_agent.py`` for CI replay."
msgstr ""
"增加 Isaac Capture MCAP 录制/回放支持，以及用于 CI 回放的非交互式 ``teleop_replay_agent.py`` 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:111
msgid ""
"Defers optional ``isaacteleop`` imports so task configs can be parsed "
"without the Isaac Capture runtime installed."
msgstr "延迟导入可选的 ``isaacteleop`` ，使未安装 Isaac Capture 运行时也能解析任务配置。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:112
msgid ""
"Improves CloudXR defaults, XR performance guidance, native "
"keyboard/gamepad/SpaceMouse mappings, and RMPFlow teleoperation behavior."
msgstr "改进 CloudXR 默认值、XR 性能建议、原生键盘/游戏手柄/SpaceMouse 映射及 RMPFlow 遥操作行为。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:114
msgid ""
"Updates Mimic installation to include ``isaaclab_teleop`` and removes the "
"obsolete ``nvidia-srl-usd-to-urdf`` dependency."
msgstr ""
"Mimic 安装现在包含 ``isaaclab_teleop`` ，移除过时的 ``nvidia-srl-usd-to-urdf`` 依赖。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:116
msgid ""
"Adds LEAPP policy export documentation and fixes RSL-RL recurrent policy "
"export, projected-gravity export, checkpoint selection, and policy-"
"deployment guides."
msgstr "增加 LEAPP 策略导出文档，修复 RSL-RL 循环策略导出、投影重力导出、检查点选择及策略部署指南。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:120
msgid "Installation, Docker & CI"
msgstr "安装、Docker 与 CI"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:122
msgid ""
"This release simplifies setup while adding significant infrastructure "
"hardening:"
msgstr "此版本简化配置，并对基础设施进行大量改进："

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:124
msgid ""
"Adds experimental root-level ``uv run train`` and ``uv run play`` workflows "
"so training and playback can be launched from a fresh checkout without "
"manually creating or activating an environment."
msgstr ""
"新增根目录下实验性的 ``uv run train`` 和 ``uv run play`` "
"工作流，让全新仓库能够直接启动训练和回放，无需手动创建或激活环境。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:126
msgid ""
"Simplifies install extras to ``isaacsim`` and ``all``, replacing older per-"
"submodule extras such as ``tasks``, ``rl``, and ``assets``."
msgstr ""
"将安装额外依赖简化为 ``isaacsim`` 和 ``all`` ，替代旧的 ``tasks`` 、 ``rl`` 、 ``assets`` "
"等按子模块划分的额外依赖。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:128
msgid ""
"Pins the released Isaac Sim Docker image to 6.0.0 and keeps Python pinned to"
" 3.12."
msgstr "将发布的 Isaac Sim Docker 镜像固定为 6.0.0，Python 仍固定为 3.12。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:129
msgid ""
"Updates PyTorch to ``2.10.0`` with CUDA 12.8 wheels on x86_64/Windows and "
"CUDA 13.0 wheels for aarch64."
msgstr ""
"PyTorch 更新至 ``2.10.0`` ：x86_64/Windows 使用 CUDA 12.8 wheel，aarch64 使用 CUDA "
"13.0 wheel。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:130
msgid ""
"Adds install CI, wheel build automation, package-scoped test runners, Docker"
" volume and non-root-user fixes, and published image tags."
msgstr "增加安装 CI、wheel 构建自动化、按包运行的测试器、Docker 数据卷及非 root 用户修复，以及已发布的镜像标签。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:132
msgid ""
"Improves aarch64, DGX Spark, ARM Docker, Windows, uv, and pip installation "
"documentation."
msgstr "改进 aarch64、DGX Spark、ARM Docker、Windows、uv 和 pip 安装文档。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:133
msgid ""
"Pins third-party GitHub Actions to commit SHAs and improves CI cleanup, "
"cancellation, sharding, diagnostics, and docs-only behavior."
msgstr "将第三方 GitHub Actions 固定到提交 SHA，改进 CI 清理、取消、分片、诊断及仅文档变更时的行为。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:137
msgid "New & Expanded Capabilities"
msgstr "新增与扩展功能"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:140 source/refs/release_notes.rst:926
#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:993 source/refs/release_notes.rst:1045
msgid "Core"
msgstr "核心功能"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:142
msgid ""
"Adds ProxyArray and asset/sensor-level property caching for faster repeated "
"data access."
msgstr "增加 ProxyArray 及资产/传感器级属性缓存，加快重复数据访问。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:143
msgid ""
"Adds scene-data provider APIs and docs for backend-neutral transform access."
msgstr "增加场景数据提供器 API 及后端中立的变换访问文档。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:144
msgid ""
"Adds schema-configuration documentation and backend-neutral deformable APIs."
msgstr "增加模式配置文档及后端中立的可变形物体 API。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:145
msgid ""
"Adds GPU transform reads, performance optimizations for asset writes, and "
"startup-time profiling tools."
msgstr "增加 GPU 变换读取、资产写入性能优化及启动耗时分析工具。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:148
msgid "Physics & Rendering Backends"
msgstr "物理与渲染后端"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:150
msgid ""
"Adds OVPhysX articulation, rigid object collection, contact sensor, frame "
"view, scene-data backend, and runtime install diagnostics."
msgstr "增加 OVPhysX 关节体、刚性物体集合、接触传感器、坐标系视图、场景数据后端及运行时安装诊断。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:152
msgid ""
"Adds HDR camera output and PPISP integration, deformable API migration, ray-"
"caster fixes, and multi-GPU Fabric frame-view support."
msgstr "增加 HDR 相机输出、PPISP 集成、可变形 API 迁移、射线投射器修复及多 GPU Fabric 坐标系视图支持。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:154
msgid ""
"Adds Newton deformable support, rigid-deformable coupling, ray-caster "
"support, solver configuration exports, contact accessors, and updated Newton"
" package pins."
msgstr "增加 Newton 可变形物体支持、刚体与可变形物体耦合、射线投射支持、求解器配置导出、接触访问器，并更新 Newton 包的固定版本。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:158 source/refs/release_notes.rst:549
#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:585 source/refs/release_notes.rst:628
msgid "Learning & Environments"
msgstr "学习与环境"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:160
msgid ""
"Adds unified ``train`` and ``play`` console entry points that dispatch by "
"``--rl_library`` across ``rsl_rl``, ``rl_games``, ``skrl``, ``sb3``, and "
"``rlinf``."
msgstr ""
"增加统一的 ``train`` 和 ``play`` 命令行入口，通过 ``--rl_library`` 在 ``rsl_rl`` 、 "
"``rl_games`` 、 ``skrl`` 、 ``sb3`` 和 ``rlinf`` 之间分派。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:162
msgid ""
"Refactors per-library train/play scripts under "
"``scripts/reinforcement_learning/`` around a shared dispatch helper, "
"reducing duplicated launcher and parser logic."
msgstr ""
"围绕共享分派辅助函数重构 ``scripts/reinforcement_learning/`` "
"下各学习库的训练/回放脚本，减少重复的启动器及解析逻辑。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:164
msgid ""
"Adds typed preset selectors such as ``physics=physx``, "
"``physics=newton_mjwarp``, and ``renderer=...`` to unified training and play"
" scripts. For example: ``train --rl_library rl_games --task=Isaac-Cartpole-"
"RGB-Camera-Direct-v0 physics=newton_mjwarp renderer=newton_renderer "
"presets=rgb``."
msgstr ""
"为统一训练和回放脚本增加带类型的预设选择项，如 ``physics=physx`` 、 ``physics=newton_mjwarp`` 和 "
"``renderer=...`` 。例如： ``train --rl_library rl_games --task=Isaac-Cartpole-"
"RGB-Camera-Direct-v0 physics=newton_mjwarp renderer=newton_renderer "
"presets=rgb`` 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:167
msgid ""
"Adds validation for unsupported backend/renderer/visualizer combinations "
"with clearer errors."
msgstr "增加对不支持的后端、渲染器、可视化器组合的验证，错误提示更清楚。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:168
msgid "Adds public helpers for enumerating task presets."
msgstr "增加用于枚举任务预设的公共辅助函数。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:169
msgid ""
"Expands Newton presets for locomotion, manipulation, navigation, and Warp-"
"first experimental environments."
msgstr "扩展运动、操作、导航及 Warp 优先实验环境的 Newton 预设。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:170
msgid "Adds success-rate metric logging across RL tasks."
msgstr "为 RL 任务增加成功率指标日志。"

