#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:175
msgid ""
"Reworks installation, quickstart, ecosystem, Docker, CloudXR, Teleop, "
"visualizer, renderer, physical-backend, migration, and environment "
"documentation."
msgstr "重写安装、快速开始、生态、Docker、CloudXR、遥操作、可视化器、渲染器、物理后端、迁移及环境文档。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:177
msgid "Adds policy-deployment guides for reach policies and LEAPP exports."
msgstr "增加 Reach 策略及 LEAPP 导出的策略部署指南。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:178
msgid ""
"Adds profiling, proxy-array, camera-output, video-recording, tiled-camera, "
"schema-cfg, and physical-backend documentation."
msgstr "增加性能分析、ProxyArray、相机输出、视频录制、平铺相机、模式配置及物理后端文档。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:180
msgid ""
"Removes remaining ``--headless`` references in favor of ``--viz`` / "
"``--visualizer``."
msgstr "移除剩余的 ``--headless`` 引用，改用 ``--viz`` / ``--visualizer`` 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:183 source/refs/release_notes.rst:458
#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1089 source/refs/release_notes.rst:1193
#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1640 source/refs/release_notes.rst:1864
#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2099 source/refs/release_notes.rst:2261
#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2473
msgid "Breaking Changes"
msgstr "不兼容变化"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:186
msgid "Preset CLI"
msgstr "预设命令行"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:188
msgid ""
"``isaaclab_tasks.utils.fold_preset_tokens`` has been removed. "
"``setup_preset_cli()`` now returns ``physics=``, ``renderer=``, and "
"``presets=`` tokens verbatim, and ``register_task()`` parses them directly. "
"Scripts should assign the returned remainder to ``sys.argv`` unchanged."
msgstr ""
"``isaaclab_tasks.utils.fold_preset_tokens`` 已移除。 ``setup_preset_cli()`` "
"现在原样返回 ``physics=`` 、 ``renderer=`` 和 ``presets=`` 选择项，由 ``register_task()``"
" 直接解析。脚本应将返回的剩余参数原样赋给 ``sys.argv`` 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:193
msgid "Teleoperation Replay"
msgstr "遥操作回放"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:195
msgid ""
"The transitional ``isaaclab_teleop.automation`` package, including "
"``XcrReplayConfig`` and ``start_xcr_replay``, has been removed. Replay "
"workflows now use Isaac Capture MCAP replay through "
"``scripts/environments/teleoperation/teleop_replay_agent.py``."
msgstr ""
"过渡性的 ``isaaclab_teleop.automation`` 包已移除，包括 ``XcrReplayConfig`` 和 "
"``start_xcr_replay`` 。回放工作流现在通过 "
"``scripts/environments/teleoperation/teleop_replay_agent.py`` 使用 Isaac "
"Capture MCAP 回放。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:199
msgid ""
"The legacy lazy ``teleop_devices`` accessor on GR1T2 pick-place environment "
"configs has also been removed. Use ``env_cfg.isaac_teleop`` or construct "
"legacy OpenXR devices explicitly."
msgstr ""
"GR1T2 抓取放置环境配置原有的延迟加载 ``teleop_devices`` 访问器也已移除。请使用 "
"``env_cfg.isaac_teleop`` ，或显式构造旧 OpenXR 设备。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:203
msgid "Deformable APIs"
msgstr "可变形物体 API"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:205
msgid ""
"Generic deformable object and material APIs have moved from "
"``isaaclab_physx`` into backend-neutral ``isaaclab.assets`` and "
"``isaaclab.sim`` imports. The old generic PhysX deformable aliases are "
"deprecated in favor of PhysX-specific names."
msgstr ""
"通用可变形物体及材料 API 已从 ``isaaclab_physx`` 移至后端中立的 ``isaaclab.assets`` 和 "
"``isaaclab.sim`` 。旧的通用 PhysX 可变形别名已弃用，改用 PhysX 专用名称。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:210
msgid "OVRTX Renderer Configuration"
msgstr "OVRTX 渲染器配置"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:212
msgid ""
"``OVRTXRendererCfg.use_cloning`` has been renamed to ``use_ovrtx_cloning``, "
"and ``temp_usd_suffix`` has been removed. Temporary USD output now uses a "
"fixed filename under ``temp_usd_dir`` when enabled."
msgstr ""
"``OVRTXRendererCfg.use_cloning`` 改名为 ``use_ovrtx_cloning`` ， "
"``temp_usd_suffix`` 已移除。启用临时 USD 输出时，在 ``temp_usd_dir`` 下使用固定文件名。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:216
msgid "Camera Aliases"
msgstr "相机别名"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:218
msgid ""
"``TiledCamera`` has been folded into ``Camera``. Existing tiled-camera "
"aliases remain as compatibility surface where available, but new code should"
" use ``Camera`` and ``CameraCfg``."
msgstr ""
"``TiledCamera`` 已并入 ``Camera`` 。已有的平铺相机别名在可用位置作为兼容接口保留，但新代码应使用 ``Camera`` 和 "
"``CameraCfg`` 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:222
msgid "Notable Fixes"
msgstr "主要修复"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:225
msgid "Core Runtime"
msgstr "核心运行时"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:227
msgid ""
"Fixes SimulationContext reset ordering so initial visualizers are created "
"before timeline event pumping can invalidate new PhysX tensor views."
msgstr "修复 SimulationContext 重置顺序，确保初始可视化器在处理时间线事件前创建，避免新 PhysX 张量视图被事件处理失效。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:229
msgid ""
"Guards environment, asset, sensor, and callback destructors during Python "
"shutdown."
msgstr "为 Python 退出期间的环境、资产、传感器及回调析构函数增加保护。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:230
msgid ""
"Fixes memory leaks when closing manager-based, direct RL, and direct MARL "
"environments."
msgstr "修复关闭基于管理器、Direct RL 和 Direct MARL 环境时的内存泄漏。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:231
msgid ""
"Fixes safe callable resolution for lambda strings by validating expressions "
"and evaluating them without Python builtins."
msgstr "通过验证表达式，并在不提供 Python 内置函数的条件下求值，修复 lambda 字符串的安全可调用对象解析。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:233
msgid ""
"Fixes local and remote asset dependency retrieval for MDL materials and "
"textures."
msgstr "修复 MDL 材质及纹理的本地和远程资产依赖获取。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:236
msgid "Backends & Sensors"
msgstr "后端与传感器"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:238
msgid ""
"Fixes stale sensor data after environment resets for PhysX and Newton "
"contact, IMU, PVA, and joint-wrench sensors."
msgstr "修复环境重置后 PhysX 和 Newton 的接触、IMU、PVA 及关节力旋量传感器数据未刷新问题。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:239
msgid ""
"Fixes PhysX scene-data rigid-body discovery when joint prims share names or "
"carry rigid-body API metadata."
msgstr "修复关节 prim 名称重复或带有刚体 API 元数据时，PhysX 场景数据中的刚体发现问题。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:240
msgid ""
"Fixes Newton and OVRTX heterogeneous replication, clone-plan path "
"resolution, and camera transform handling."
msgstr "修复 Newton 和 OVRTX 异构复制、克隆计划路径解析及相机变换处理。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:241
msgid ""
"Fixes OVPhysX optional runtime pins and missing-runtime install errors."
msgstr "修复 OVPhysX 可选运行时版本固定及缺少运行时的安装错误。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:242
msgid ""
"Fixes OVRTX package resolution so PPISP is only required when camera ISP is "
"configured."
msgstr "修复 OVRTX 包解析，仅在配置相机 ISP 时要求 PPISP。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:245
msgid "Training & Deployment"
msgstr "训练与部署"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:247
msgid ""
"Fixes ``rl_games`` and SB3 checkpoint fallback when best/final checkpoints "
"are not yet written."
msgstr "修复最佳/最终检查点尚未写出时， ``rl_games`` 和 SB3 的检查点回退。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:248
msgid ""
"Fixes skrl JAX multihost imports, RSL-RL recurrent LEAPP export, and LEAPP "
"projected-gravity export."
msgstr "修复 skrl JAX 多主机导入、RSL-RL 循环策略 LEAPP 导出及 LEAPP 投影重力导出。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:249
msgid ""
"Fixes AutoMate PhysX sizing, assembly ID validation, Numba dependency "
"removal, and downstream argument forwarding."
msgstr "修复 AutoMate 的 PhysX 容量设置、装配 ID 验证、Numba 依赖移除及下游参数转发。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:250
msgid "Fixes RLinf optional dependencies for DGX Spark and aarch64."
msgstr "修复 DGX Spark 和 aarch64 的 RLinf 可选依赖。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:251
msgid ""
"Fixes native teleoperation mappings for Franka reach tasks and RMPFlow "
"quaternion handling."
msgstr "修复 Franka Reach 任务的原生遥操作映射，以及 RMPFlow 四元数处理。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:254 source/refs/release_notes.rst:500
msgid "Updated Dependencies"
msgstr "依赖更新"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:256
msgid "Isaac Sim 6.0.0 Docker image."
msgstr "Isaac Sim 6.0.0 Docker 镜像。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:257
msgid "Python ``>=3.12,<3.13``."
msgstr "Python ``>=3.12,<3.13`` 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:258
msgid "PyTorch ``2.10.0``, TorchAudio ``2.10.0``, TorchVision ``0.25.0``."
msgstr "PyTorch ``2.10.0`` 、TorchAudio ``2.10.0`` 、TorchVision ``0.25.0`` 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:259
msgid ""
"CUDA 12.8 PyTorch wheels for Linux x86_64, Windows, and AMD64 markers; CUDA "
"13.0 wheels for Linux aarch64/arm64 markers."
msgstr ""
"Linux x86_64、Windows 及 AMD64 平台标记使用 CUDA 12.8 PyTorch wheel，Linux "
"aarch64/arm64 平台标记使用 CUDA 13.0 wheel。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:261
msgid "Newton package pins updated along the 1.2.1 line."
msgstr "Newton 包的固定版本沿 1.2.1 系列更新。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:262
msgid "OVPhysX optional runtime pinned to ``ovphysx==0.4.13``."
msgstr "OVPhysX 可选运行时固定为 ``ovphysx==0.4.13`` 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:263
msgid "OVRTX optional runtime updated along the 0.3.x line."
msgstr "OVRTX 可选运行时沿 0.3.x 系列更新。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:264
msgid "``pyglet>=2.1.6,<3`` added for Newton GL video recording."
msgstr "增加 ``pyglet>=2.1.6,<3`` ，支持 Newton GL 视频录制。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:265
msgid ""
"``isaaclab_ppisp`` added as the shared camera ISP extension, loaded by "
"renderers only when camera ISP is configured."
msgstr "新增 ``isaaclab_ppisp`` 作为共享相机 ISP 扩展，仅在配置相机 ISP 时由渲染器加载。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:268 source/refs/release_notes.rst:508
msgid "Known Limitations"
msgstr "已知限制"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:270
msgid ""
"This remains a beta release; the release branch may still receive breaking "
"changes before the final Isaac Lab 3.0 release. We anticipate the branch "
"will stabilize towards a final Isaac Lab 3.0 release in the coming 1-2 "
"months."
msgstr ""
"这仍是测试版本，最终 Isaac Lab 3.0 发布前，发布分支仍可能出现不兼容变化。我们预计分支将在未来 1–2 个月内逐渐稳定，形成正式版本。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:272
msgid ""
"Newton remains under active development. Some features, task presets, and "
"surface gripper workflows remain backend-specific or unsupported."
msgstr "Newton 仍在积极开发。部分功能、任务预设和表面夹爪工作流仍为后端专用或不受支持。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:274
msgid ""
"Surface grippers require CPU simulation with ``physics=isaacsim_physx``, "
"including the UR10 Long/Short Suction and Galbot Right Arm Suction stacking "
"tasks and the Galbot Mimic variants. Pass ``--device cpu`` for "
"teleoperation; zero and random agents preserve the tasks' CPU defaults when "
"``--device`` is omitted."
msgstr ""
"表面夹爪要求在 ``physics=isaacsim_physx`` 上采用 CPU 仿真，包括 UR10 Long/Short "
"Suction、Galbot Right Arm Suction 堆叠任务及 Galbot Mimic 变体。遥操作请传入 ``--device "
"cpu`` ；零动作和随机动作智能体未指定 ``--device`` 时会保留任务默认的 CPU 设置。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:277
msgid ""
"Pink IK dependencies are provided by the standard installation only on Linux"
" x86_64 and aarch64. The Windows uv/pip installation does not provide "
"Pinocchio, so Pink IK tasks cannot run with that installation."
msgstr ""
"标准安装仅在 Linux x86_64 和 aarch64 上提供 Pink IK 依赖。Windows uv/pip 安装不提供 "
"Pinocchio，因此无法运行 Pink IK 任务。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:279
msgid ""
"OVRTX and OVPhysX require their optional runtime wheels. Isaac Lab now "
"reports clearer install guidance when those wheels are missing, but those "
"backends are still optional installs."
msgstr ""
"OVRTX 和 OVPhysX 需要各自的可选运行时 wheel。Isaac Lab 现在会在缺失时提供更清楚的安装指导，但这些后端仍需按需安装。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:283
msgid "Migration Notes"
msgstr "迁移说明"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:285
msgid ""
"Replace ``--headless`` usage with ``--viz`` / ``--visualizer`` or omit "
"visualizers for fully headless runs."
msgstr ""
"将 ``--headless`` 用法改为 ``--viz`` / ``--visualizer`` ，或不启用可视化器，以完全无界面运行。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:286
msgid ""
"Replace ``presets=...`` only where broad preset broadcast is intended; "
"prefer typed selectors such as ``physics=...`` and ``renderer=...`` when "
"selecting backend-specific behavior."
msgstr ""
"只有需要广泛广播预设时才使用 ``presets=...`` ；选择后端专用行为时，优先采用 ``physics=...`` 、 "
"``renderer=...`` 等带类型选择项。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:288
msgid ""
"Remove ``fold_preset_tokens(...)`` wrappers from custom scripts that "
"integrate with the preset CLI."
msgstr "自定义脚本集成预设命令行时，移除 ``fold_preset_tokens(...)`` 包装。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:289
msgid ""
"Move deformable imports to backend-neutral ``isaaclab.assets`` and "
"``isaaclab.sim`` APIs where possible."
msgstr "尽可能将可变形物体导入改为后端中立的 ``isaaclab.assets`` 和 ``isaaclab.sim`` API。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:290
msgid "Migrate tiled-camera code toward ``Camera`` / ``CameraCfg``."
msgstr "将平铺相机代码迁移到 ``Camera`` 和 ``CameraCfg`` 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:291
msgid ""
"Use ``ProxyArray.torch`` or ``ProxyArray.warp`` explicitly when crossing "
"between Torch and Warp code."
msgstr ""
"跨 Torch 和 Warp 代码传递数据时，显式使用 ``ProxyArray.torch`` 或 ``ProxyArray.warp`` 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:292
msgid ""
"Use Isaac Capture MCAP replay and ``teleop_replay_agent.py`` for replay "
"automation instead of the removed XCR automation helpers."
msgstr ""
"回放自动化采用 Isaac Capture MCAP 回放和 ``teleop_replay_agent.py`` ，不再使用已移除的 XCR "
"自动化辅助函数。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:296
msgid "v3.0.0-beta"
msgstr "v3.0.0-beta"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:298
msgid ""
"`View this release on GitHub <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/releases/tag/v3.0.0-beta>`__."
msgstr ""
"`在 GitHub 查看此版本 <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/releases/tag/v3.0.0-beta>`__ 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:300
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab 3.0 Beta is the next major release of Isaac Lab, built on **Isaac "
"Sim 6.0** and introducing a ground-up architectural overhaul. This release "
"brings multi-backend physics, a pluggable renderer system, Warp-native data "
"pipelines, and a kit-less installation mode — enabling faster, more flexible"
" robot learning research."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 3.0 Beta 是下一代主要版本，基于 **Isaac Sim 6.0** "
"，对架构进行了全面重构。引入多后端物理、可插拔渲染器系统、Warp 原生数据流水线及无 Kit 安装模式，为机器人学习研究提供更快、更灵活的工具。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:306
msgid ""
"This is a beta release. The ``develop`` branch is under active development "
"and may experience breaking changes, error messages, or performance "
"regressions in some use cases."
msgstr "这是测试版本。 ``develop`` 分支仍在积极开发，某些使用场景可能出现不兼容变化、错误消息或性能回退。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:313
msgid "Multi-Backend Physics Architecture"
msgstr "多后端物理架构"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:315
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab 3.0 introduces a **factory-based multi-backend architecture** that"
" separates simulation backend-specific code from the core API. Asset and "
"sensor classes (e.g., ``Articulation``, ``RigidObject``, and "
"``ContactSensor``) are now backed by abstract base classes, with backend-"
"specific implementations in dedicated extension packages:"
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 3.0 引入 **基于工厂的多后端架构** ，将仿真后端专用代码与核心 API 分离。资产及传感器类，如 "
"``Articulation`` 、 ``RigidObject`` 和 ``ContactSensor`` "
"，现在以抽象基类为基础，在专用扩展包中提供各后端实现："

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:320
msgid ""
"**``isaaclab_physx``** — Full PhysX backend (default), including deformable "
"objects, surface grippers, contact sensors, IMU, and frame transformers."
msgstr "``isaaclab_physx`` ：完整 PhysX 后端（默认），包括可变形物体、表面夹爪、接触传感器、IMU 及坐标变换器。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:322
msgid ""
"**``isaaclab_newton``** — New Newton physics backend powered by MuJoCo-Warp,"
" supporting MJWarp, XPBD, and Featherstone solvers with CUDA-graph "
"acceleration."
msgstr ""
"``isaaclab_newton`` ：基于 MuJoCo-Warp 的新 Newton 物理后端，支持 MJWarp、XPBD 和 "
"Featherstone 求解器，并通过 CUDA 图加速。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:325
msgid ""
"Your existing imports from ``isaaclab.assets`` and ``isaaclab.sensors`` "
"continue to work — the factory automatically dispatches to the active "
"backend at runtime."
msgstr ""
"现有的 ``isaaclab.assets`` 和 ``isaaclab.sensors`` 导入仍有效，工厂会在运行时自动分派到当前后端。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:329
msgid "Newton Physics Backend"
msgstr "Newton 物理后端"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:331
msgid ""
"The new ``isaaclab_newton`` extension enables running Isaac Lab environments"
" **without Isaac Sim** (kit-less mode). Newton support includes:"
msgstr ""
"新的 ``isaaclab_newton`` 扩展支持 **不依赖 Isaac Sim** 运行环境，即无 Kit 模式。Newton 支持包括："

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:334
msgid "Articulations, rigid objects, and rigid object collections."
msgstr "关节体、刚性物体及刚性物体集合。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:335
msgid "Contact sensors."
msgstr "接触传感器。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:336
msgid ""
"MuJoCo-Warp solver with configurable integrators (``implicitfast``, "
"``euler``) and contact models (``pyramidal``, ``elliptic``)."
msgstr ""
"MuJoCo-Warp 求解器，具有可配置积分器（ ``implicitfast`` 、 ``euler`` ）及接触模型（ ``pyramidal``"
" 、 ``elliptic`` ）。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:338
msgid "CUDA graph support for high-throughput stepping."
msgstr "CUDA 图支持，用于高吞吐量仿真步进。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:339
msgid ""
"Newton-compatible presets for 20+ environments (locomotion, manipulation, "
"classic control)."
msgstr "20 多个环境的 Newton 兼容预设，涵盖运动、操作和经典控制。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:342
msgid "Pluggable Renderer System"
msgstr "可插拔渲染器系统"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:344
msgid ""
"A new ``BaseRenderer`` abstraction supports configuration-owned "
"implementations managed by ``RenderContext``:"
msgstr "新增 ``BaseRenderer`` 抽象，由配置指定实现，通过 ``RenderContext`` 管理："

