#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:417
msgid "Warp-Native Data Pipeline"
msgstr "Warp 原生数据流水线"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:419
msgid ""
"All ``.data.*`` properties on asset and sensor classes now return "
"**``wp.array``** (NVIDIA Warp) instead of ``torch.Tensor``. Internal state "
"buffers use structured warp types (``wp.vec3f``, ``wp.quatf``, "
"``wp.transformf``, ``wp.spatial_vectorf``), and fused GPU kernels replace "
"Python-level loops for state extraction, velocity transforms, and data "
"write-back. Convert back to torch with ``wp.to_torch()`` when needed."
msgstr ""
"资产和传感器类的所有 ``.data.*`` 属性现在返回 ``wp.array`` （NVIDIA Warp），而非 ``torch.Tensor``"
" 。内部状态缓冲区使用结构化 Warp 类型，如 ``wp.vec3f`` 、 ``wp.quatf`` 、 ``wp.transformf`` 、 "
"``wp.spatial_vectorf`` ；状态提取、速度变换及数据写回采用融合 GPU 核函数，替代 Python 层循环。需要时，通过 "
"``wp.to_torch()`` 转回 Torch。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:425
msgid "Preset System for Multi-Backend Environments"
msgstr "多后端环境预设系统"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:427
msgid ""
"A new ``PresetCfg`` pattern allows a single environment config to declare "
"named variants for different backends. Select a preset at launch:"
msgstr "新的 ``PresetCfg`` 模式让一个环境配置能够声明不同后端的具名变体。启动时选择预设："

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:430
msgid "Run with Newton backend:"
msgstr "使用 Newton 后端运行："

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:436
msgid "Run with default PhysX backend:"
msgstr "使用默认 PhysX 后端运行："

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:443
msgid "Lazy Exporting & Resolvable Strings"
msgstr "延迟导出与可解析字符串"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:445
msgid ""
"All packages now use lazy exporting with ``.pyi`` stubs, so importing a top-"
"level module (e.g., ``import isaaclab.sensors``) no longer eagerly pulls in "
"heavyweight dependencies. Config fields like ``class_type`` store references"
" as resolvable strings that are resolved only after ``SimulationApp`` is "
"initialized, enabling automatic physics-backend selection."
msgstr ""
"所有包现在采用带 ``.pyi`` 类型存根的延迟导出，导入顶层模块（如 ``import isaaclab.sensors`` "
"）不再立即加载重量级依赖。 ``class_type`` 等配置字段将引用存储为可解析字符串，直到 ``SimulationApp`` "
"初始化后才解析，从而支持自动选择物理后端。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:451
msgid "Isaac Capture Integration"
msgstr "Isaac Capture 集成"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:453
msgid ""
"XR teleoperation is now powered by Isaac Capture via the new "
"``isaaclab_teleop`` extension, replacing the previous "
"``isaaclab.devices.openxr`` stack. The new system provides a unified "
"teleoperation interface with pipeline-based retargeting configuration."
msgstr ""
"XR 遥操作现在由新的 ``isaaclab_teleop`` 扩展集成 Isaac Capture，替代原有 "
"``isaaclab.devices.openxr`` 组件。新系统提供统一遥操作接口，通过流水线配置重定向。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:461
msgid "Quaternion Format: WXYZ → XYZW"
msgstr "四元数格式：WXYZ → XYZW"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:463
msgid ""
"All quaternions throughout Isaac Lab now use XYZW ordering to align with "
"Warp, PhysX, and Newton conventions. Hard-coded quaternion values must be "
"updated. A quaternion finder tool is provided to help locate and fix "
"quaternions."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 中所有四元数现在采用 XYZW 顺序，与 Warp、PhysX 和 Newton "
"一致。写死的四元数值必须更新，提供的四元数查找工具可帮助定位和修复。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:468
msgid "Data Properties Return ``wp.array``"
msgstr "数据属性返回 ``wp.array``"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:470
msgid ""
"All ``.data.*`` properties now return ``wp.array``. Wrap with "
"``wp.to_torch()`` for PyTorch compatibility. An automated migration tool is "
"available at ``scripts/tools/wrap_warp_to_torch.py``."
msgstr ""
"所有 ``.data.*`` 属性现在返回 ``wp.array`` 。通过 ``wp.to_torch()`` 转换可兼容 "
"PyTorch。自动迁移工具位于 ``scripts/tools/wrap_warp_to_torch.py`` 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:474
msgid "Write Method Index/Mask Split"
msgstr "写入方法拆分为索引与掩码形式"

