#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:525
msgid "v2.3.2"
msgstr "v2.3.2"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:530
msgid ""
"This release focuses on stability, infrastructure improvements, workflow "
"refinements, and incremental feature expansions, along with some significant"
" new features, including **Multirotor and thruster support for drones**, "
"**Multi-mesh RayCaster**, **Visual-based tactile sensor**, **Haply device "
"integration**, and new **OpenArm environments**. It includes improvements to"
" training workflows, teleoperation and Mimic pipelines, Ray integration, "
"simulation utilities, and developer tooling, along with a large number of "
"robustness and quality-of-life fixes."
msgstr ""
"此版本重点改进稳定性、基础设施和工作流，并逐步扩展功能。主要新增功能包括 **无人机多旋翼及推进器支持** 、 **多网格射线投射器** 、 "
"**视觉触觉传感器** 、 **Haply 设备集成** 和新的 **OpenArm 环境** 。改进了训练工作流、遥操作与 Mimic 流水线、Ray"
" 集成、仿真工具及开发工具，并包含大量提升可靠性和易用性的修复。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:532
msgid ""
"This will be our final release on the current **main** branch as we shift "
"our development focus towards the **develop** branch. We anticipate large "
"restructuring changes to happen on **develop**. While we hope to continue "
"taking in contributions from the community, we will focus more time on our "
"development towards Isaac Lab 3.0. For existing PRs, please re-target the "
"target branch to **develop** to stay up-to-date with the latest changes."
msgstr ""
"这是当前 **main** 分支的最后一个发布版本，开发重点将转向 **develop** "
"，预计该分支会进行大规模重构。我们仍希望继续接收社区贡献，但将投入更多时间开发 Isaac Lab 3.0。现有 PR 请将目标分支改为 "
"**develop** ，以跟进最新变化。"

