#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:847
msgid ""
"This is a small patch release with a few critical fixes that impacted user "
"workflows."
msgstr "这是小型补丁版本，修复了影响用户工作流的几个关键问题。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:849
msgid ""
"Key fixes include: * The behavior of termination logging has changed in the "
"manager-based workflow, where ``get_done_term`` now returns the current step"
" value instead of the last episode value. * Additionally, a breaking change "
"in the URDF importer was introduced in Isaac Sim 5.1, where the merge joints"
" flag is no longer supported. We have now introduced a patch in the importer"
" to return the behavior. Moving forward, we plan to deprecate this flag in "
"favor of preserving asset definitions from URDFs directly without performing"
" additional processing during the import process."
msgstr ""
"主要修复包括：* 基于管理器的工作流更改终止日志行为， ``get_done_term`` 现在返回当前步的值，而非上一回合的值。* Isaac Sim"
" 5.1 的 URDF 导入器引入不兼容变化，不再支持合并关节标志。我们已通过导入器补丁恢复该行为。后续计划弃用此标志，直接保留 URDF "
"的资产定义，不在导入过程中额外处理。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:856
