#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:911
msgid ""
"Introduced support for `DGX Spark <https://www.nvidia.com/en-"
"us/products/workstations/dgx-spark/>`_, including multi-architecture Docker "
"images with support for ARM platforms."
msgstr ""
"新增 `DGX Spark <https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/products/workstations/dgx-"
"spark/>`_ 支持，包括兼容 ARM 平台的多架构 Docker 镜像。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:913
msgid ""
"PhysX now offers a new joint parameter tuning `tutorial "
"<https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/kit/docs/omni_physics/107.3/dev_guide/guides/gripper_tuning_example.html>`_"
" for robotic grippers, along with a new feature for solving articulation "
"collision contacts last to improve on gripper penetration issues, especially"
" for cases with sub-optimally tuned joints."
msgstr ""
"PhysX 提供新的机器人夹爪关节参数调优 `教程 "
"<https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/kit/docs/omni_physics/107.3/dev_guide/guides/gripper_tuning_example.html>`_"
" ，并新增最后求解关节体碰撞接触的功能，改善夹爪穿透，尤其适用于关节调参不够理想的情况。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:916
