"Surface grippers has been optimized for better performance. Although support"
" continues to be CPU-only, performance has improved by several orders of "
"magnitude compared to previous releases."
msgstr "表面夹爪已优化性能。虽然仍仅支持 CPU，但相比旧版本已提升数个数量级。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:918
