#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1097
msgid ""
"The ROS2 docker image is not currently expected to work due to the update to"
" Python 3.11. We are actively working on a fix to resolve this."
msgstr "由于更新到 Python 3.11，ROS 2 Docker 镜像目前预计无法正常工作。我们正在修复。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1099
msgid ""
"We have received reports of performance regressions in the previous Isaac "
"Sim release for both physics and rendering workflows. We are still working "
"on addressing some of these, but have also found some workarounds. For "
"viewport regressions, Omniverse settings can be set by adding "
"``--kit_args=\"--/app/usdrt/hierarchy/partialGpuUpdate=1 "
"--/rtx/post/dlss/execMode=0 --/app/runLoops/main/rateLimitEnabled=false "
"--/app/runLoops/main/manualModeEnabled=true --enable omni.kit.loop-"
"isaac\"``. Additionally, Isaac Sim 5.0 introduced new actuator models for "
"PhysX, including drive model and friction model improvements. These "
"improvements also introduced a small performance regression. We have "
"observed up to ~20% slowdown in some state-based environments."
msgstr ""
"我们收到报告，上一 Isaac Sim 版本的物理和渲染工作流均有性能回退。部分问题仍在解决中，也找到了一些临时办法。视口性能回退可通过添加 "
"``--kit_args=\"--/app/usdrt/hierarchy/partialGpuUpdate=1 "
"--/rtx/post/dlss/execMode=0 --/app/runLoops/main/rateLimitEnabled=false "
"--/app/runLoops/main/manualModeEnabled=true --enable omni.kit.loop-isaac\"``"
" 设置 Omniverse 参数。此外，Isaac Sim 5.0 为 PhysX "
"引入新的执行器模型，改进驱动及摩擦模型，但也带来小幅性能下降。某些基于状态的环境中，我们观察到约 20% 的减速。"

