msgid ""
"**Isaac Lab 2.2** brings major upgrades across simulation capabilities, "
"tooling, and developer experience. It expands support for advanced physics "
"features, new environments, and improved testing and documentation "
"workflows. This release includes full compatibility with **Isaac Sim 5.0** "
"as well as backwards compatibility with **Isaac Sim 4.5**."
msgstr ""
"**Isaac Lab 2.2** 在仿真能力、工具和开发体验方面带来重大升级。扩展高级物理功能、新环境，以及测试和文档工作流。完整兼容 **Isaac"
" Sim 5.0** ，也向后兼容 **Isaac Sim 4.5** 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1208
msgid ""
"**Enhanced Physics Support**: Updated `joint friction modeling using the "
"latest PhysX APIs <https://nvidia-"
"omniverse.github.io/PhysX/physx/5.6.1/docs/Articulations.html#articulation-"
"joint-friction>`_, added support for `spatial tendons <https://nvidia-"
"omniverse.github.io/PhysX/physx/5.6.1/docs/Articulations.html#spatial-"
"tendons>`_, and improved surface gripper interactions."
msgstr ""
"**物理支持增强** ：使用最新 PhysX API 更新 `关节摩擦建模 <https://nvidia-"
"omniverse.github.io/PhysX/physx/5.6.1/docs/Articulations.html#articulation-"
"joint-friction>`_ ，新增 `空间肌腱 <https://nvidia-"
"omniverse.github.io/PhysX/physx/5.6.1/docs/Articulations.html#spatial-"
"tendons>`_ 支持，改进表面夹爪交互。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1209
msgid ""
"**New Environments for Imitation Learning**: Introduction of two new GR1 "
"mimic environments, with domain randomization and visual robustness "
"evaluation, and improved pick-and-place tasks."
msgstr "**模仿学习新环境** ：新增两个 GR1 Mimic 环境，支持域随机化及视觉鲁棒性评估，并改进抓取放置任务。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1210
msgid ""
"**New Contact-Rich Manipulation Tasks**: Integration of `FORGE "
"<https://noseworm.github.io/forge/>`_ and `AutoMate "
"<https://bingjietang718.github.io/automate/>`_ tasks for learning fine-"
"grained contact interactions in simulation."
msgstr ""
"**接触密集操作新任务** ：集成 `FORGE <https://noseworm.github.io/forge/>`_ 和 `AutoMate "
"<https://bingjietang718.github.io/automate/>`_ ，用于在仿真中学习精细接触交互。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1211
msgid ""
"**Teleoperation Improvements**: Teleoperation tools have been enhanced with "
"configurable parameters and CloudXR runtime updates, including head tracking"
" and hand tracking."
msgstr "**遥操作改进** ：增加可配置参数，更新 CloudXR 运行时，支持头部及手部跟踪。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1212
msgid ""
"**Performance & Usability Improvements**: Includes support for Stage in "
"Memory and Cloning in Fabric for faster scene creation, new OVD recorder for"
" large-scene GPU-based animation recording, and FSD (Fabric Scene Delegate) "
"for improved rendering speed."
msgstr ""
"**性能与易用性改进** ：支持内存舞台及 Fabric 克隆，加快场景创建；新增 OVD 录制器，对大型场景进行 GPU 动画录制；通过 "
"FSD（Fabric Scene Delegate）提高渲染速度。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1213
msgid ""
"**Improved Documentation**: The documentation has been extended and updated "
"to cover new features, resolve common issues, and streamline setup, "
"including updates to teleop system requirements, VS Code integration, and "
"Python environment management."
msgstr "**文档改进** ：扩充并更新新功能、常见问题和安装配置文档，包括遥操作系统要求、VS Code 集成及 Python 环境管理。"

