msgid ""
"**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/compare/v2.1.1...v2.2.0"
msgstr ""
"**完整变更日志** ：https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab/compare/v2.1.1...v2.2.0"

