#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1603
msgid "**WebRTC Support**: Added IP specification for live-streaming"
msgstr "**WebRTC 支持** ：直播可指定 IP。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1605
msgid ""
"**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/compare/v2.0.1...v2.0.2"
msgstr ""
"**完整变更日志** ：https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab/compare/v2.0.1...v2.0.2"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1610
msgid ""
"Adds :attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg.velocity_limit_sim` and "
