#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1651
msgid ""
"We strongly recommend reviewing the details to fully understand the change "
"in behavior, as it may impact the deployment of learned policies. Please "
"open an issue on GitHub if you face any problems."
msgstr "这些行为变化可能影响已训练策略的部署，强烈建议仔细阅读。遇到问题请在 GitHub 提交 issue。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1657
msgid ""
"Introduction of simulation's effort and velocity limits parameters in "
"ActuatorBaseCfg"
msgstr "ActuatorBaseCfg 新增仿真驱动力及速度限值参数"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1659
msgid ""
"We have introduced the configuration variables "
":attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg.velocity_limit_sim` and "
":attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg.effort_limit_sim` to the "
":class:`isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg` to allow users to set the "
"**simulation** joint velocity and effort limits through the actuator "
"configuration class."
msgstr ""
"我们在 :class:`isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg` 中新增 "
":attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg.velocity_limit_sim` 和 "
":attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg.effort_limit_sim` ，允许通过执行器配置类设置 "
"**仿真** 关节速度及驱动力限值。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1664
msgid ""
"Previously, we were overusing the attributes "
":attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg.velocity_limit` and "
":attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg.effort_limit` inside the actuator"
" configuration. A series of changes in-between led to a regression from "
"v1.4.0 to v2.0.1 release of IsaacLab. To make this clearer to understand, we"
" note the change in their behavior in a tabular form:"
msgstr ""
"以前，执行器配置中的 :attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg.velocity_limit` 和 "
":attr:`~isaaclab.actuators.ActuatorBaseCfg.effort_limit` 承担了过多职责。期间一系列修改导致 "
"Isaac Lab 从 v1.4.0 到 v2.0.1 出现行为回归。为便于理解，下表列出行为变化："

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1672
msgid "Actuator Type"
msgstr "执行器类型"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1673 source/refs/release_notes.rst:1707
msgid "Attribute"
msgstr "属性"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1674
msgid "v1.4.0 Behavior"
msgstr "v1.4.0 行为"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1675
msgid "v2.0.1 Behavior"
msgstr "v2.0.1 行为"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1694
msgid ""
"Setting the limits from the configuration into the simulation directly "
"affects the behavior of the underlying physics engine solver. This impact is"
" particularly noticeable when velocity limits are too restrictive, "
"especially in joints with high stiffness, where it becomes easier to reach "
"these limits. As a result, the change in behavior caused previously trained "
"policies to not function correctly in IsaacLab v2.0.1."
msgstr ""
"将配置限值写入仿真，会直接影响底层物理求解器的行为。速度限值过于严格时尤其明显，高刚度关节更容易达到这些限值。因此，行为变化导致此前训练的策略无法在 "
"Isaac Lab v2.0.1 中正常工作。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1700
msgid ""
"Consequently, we have reverted back to the prior behavior and added "
":attr:`velocity_limit_sim` and :attr:`effort_limit_sim` attributes to make "
"it clear that setting those parameters means changing solver's "
"configuration. The new behavior is as follows:"
msgstr ""
"我们因此恢复了旧行为，并新增 :attr:`velocity_limit_sim` 和 :attr:`effort_limit_sim` "
"，明确这些参数修改的是求解器配置。新行为如下："

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1708
msgid "Implicit Actuator"
msgstr "隐式执行器"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1709
msgid "Explicit Actuator"
msgstr "显式执行器"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1724
msgid ""
"Users are advised to use the ``xxx_sim`` flag if they want to directly "
"modify the solver limits."
msgstr "需要直接修改求解器限值时，建议使用 ``xxx_sim`` 参数。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1727
msgid "Removal of ``disable_contact_processing`` flag in ``SimulationCfg``"
msgstr "移除 ``SimulationCfg`` 的 ``disable_contact_processing`` 标志"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1729
msgid ""
"We have now removed the ``disable_contact_processing`` flag from the "
":class:`isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg` to not have the user worry about these "
"intricacies of the simulator. The flag is always True by default unless a "
"contact sensor is created (which will internally set this flag to False)."
msgstr ""
"我们从 :class:`isaaclab.sim.SimulationCfg` 移除 ``disable_contact_processing`` "
"，避免用户需要处理这些仿真器细节。默认始终为 True；创建接触传感器后，会在内部将其设为 False。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1733
msgid ""
"Previously, the flag ``disable_contact_processing`` led to confusion about "
"its behavior. As the name suggests, the flag controls the contact reporting "
"from the underlying physics engine, PhysX. Disabling this flag (note the "
"double negation) means that PhysX collects the contact information from its "
"solver and allows reporting them to the user. Enabling this flag means this "
"operation is not performed and the overhead of it is avoided."
msgstr ""
"此前， ``disable_contact_processing`` 的行为容易引起困惑。顾名思义，它控制底层 PhysX "
"物理引擎的接触报告。禁用该标志（注意这里的双重否定）意味着 PhysX 从求解器收集接触信息，并允许向用户报告；启用则不执行此操作，避免相关开销。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1740
msgid ""
"Many of our examples (for instance, the locomotion environments) were "
"setting this flag to True which meant the contacts should **not** get "
"reported. However, this issue was not noticed earlier since GPU simulation "
"bypasses this flag, and only CPU simulation gets affected. Running the same "
"examples on CPU device led to different behaviors because of this reason."
msgstr ""
"许多示例，如运动环境，将此标志设为 True，即 **不应** 报告接触。但 GPU 仿真绕过该标志，只有 CPU 仿真受影响，因此此前未发现问题。在 "
"CPU 上运行相同示例时，就会出现不同的行为。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1746
msgid ""
"Existing users, who currently set this flag themselves, should receive a "
"deprecated warning mentioning the removal of this flag and the switch to the"
" new default behavior."
msgstr "仍自行设置该标志的用户，应收到弃用警告，说明标志已移除并改用新的默认行为。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1750
msgid "Switch to older rendering settings to improve render quality"
msgstr "恢复旧渲染设置以改善画质"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1752
msgid ""
"With the IsaacLab 2.0.0 release, we switched to new render settings aimed at"
" improving tiled-rendering performance, but at the cost of reduced rendering"
" quality. This change particularly affected dome lighting in the scene, "
"which is the default in many of our examples."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab 2.0.0 采用了新的渲染设置，以提高平铺渲染的性能，但画质有所下降。这一变化尤其影响场景中的穹顶光照，而许多示例默认使用这类光照。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1756
msgid ""
"As reported by several users, this change negatively impacted render "
"quality, even in cases where it wasn't necessary (such as when recording "
"videos of the simulation). In response to this feedback, we have reverted to"
" the previous render settings by default to restore the quality users "
"expected."
msgstr ""
"多位用户反馈，新设置在一些无需牺牲画质的场景（例如录制仿真视频）中也降低了渲染质量。因此，我们已恢复原先的默认渲染设置，使画质达到用户预期。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1761
msgid ""
"For users looking to trade render quality for speed, we will provide "
"guidelines in the future."
msgstr "对于愿意降低画质以换取速度的用户，我们后续会提供相应指南。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1765
msgid "v2.0.1"
msgstr "v2.0.1"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1770
msgid "This release contains a small set of fixes and improvements."
msgstr "本版本包含少量修复和改进。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1772
msgid ""
"The main change was to maintain combability with the updated library name "
"for RSL RL, which breaks the previous installation methods for Isaac Lab. "
"This release provides the necessary fixes and updates in Isaac Lab to "
"accommodate for the name change and maintain compatibility with installation"
" for RSL RL."
msgstr ""
"本次主要调整是适配 RSL RL 的新包名。包名变更导致 Isaac Lab 原有的安装方式失效；本版本更新了相关配置，确保能够正常安装 RSL RL。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1776
