#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1795
msgid "v2.0.0"
msgstr "v2.0.0"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1800
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab 2.0 brings some exciting new features, including a new addition to"
" the Imitation Learning workflow with the **Isaac Lab Mimic** extension."
msgstr "Isaac Lab 2.0 新增多项功能，其中 **Isaac Lab Mimic** 扩展进一步完善了模仿学习工作流。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1803
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab Mimic provides the ability to automatically generate additional "
"trajectories based on just a few human collected demonstrations, allowing "
"for larger training datasets with less human effort. This work is based on "
"the `MimicGen <https://mimicgen.github.io/>`_ work for Scalable Robot "
"Learning using Human Demonstrations."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Lab Mimic 能以少量人工采集的示范为基础，自动生成更多轨迹，减少构建大型训练数据集所需的人力。该扩展基于 `MimicGen "
"<https://mimicgen.github.io/>`_ ，通过人类示范实现可扩展的机器人学习。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1807
msgid ""
"Additionally, we introduced a new set of AMP tasks based on `Adversarial "
"Motion Priors <https://xbpeng.github.io/projects/AMP/index.html>`_, training"
" humanoid robots to walk, run, and dance."
msgstr ""
"此外，我们新增了一组基于 `对抗运动先验（Adversarial Motion Priors） "
"<https://xbpeng.github.io/projects/AMP/index.html>`_ 的 AMP "
"任务，用于训练人形机器人行走、奔跑和跳舞。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1811
msgid ""
"Along with Isaac Lab 2.0, Isaac Sim 4.5 brings several new and breaking "
"changes, including a full refactor of the Isaac Sim extensions, an improved "
"URDF importer, an update to the PyTorch dependency to version 2.5.1, and "
"many fixes for tiled rendering that now supports multiple tiled cameras at "
"different resolutions."
msgstr ""
"与 Isaac Lab 2.0 配套的 Isaac Sim 4.5 引入了多项新增功能和破坏性变更，包括全面重构 Isaac Sim 扩展、改进 "
"URDF 导入器、将 PyTorch 依赖升级至 2.5.1，以及修复多项平铺渲染问题。平铺渲染现已支持多个不同分辨率的平铺相机。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1815
msgid ""
"To follow the refactoring in Isaac Sim, we made similar refactoring and "
"restructuring changes to Isaac Lab. These breaking changes will no longer be"
" compatible with previous Isaac Sim versions."
msgstr ""
"为适配 Isaac Sim 的重构，我们也重构并调整了 Isaac Lab 的目录结构。这些破坏性变更使本版本无法兼容此前的 Isaac Sim 版本。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1820
msgid ""
"Please make sure to update to Isaac Sim 4.5 when using the Isaac Lab 2.0 "
"release."
msgstr "使用 Isaac Lab 2.0 时，请确保已升级到 Isaac Sim 4.5。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1822
msgid ""
"**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/compare/v1.4.1...v2.0.0"
msgstr ""
"**完整变更记录** ：https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab/compare/v1.4.1...v2.0.0"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1825
msgid "Highlights from the Isaac Sim 4.5 release"
msgstr "Isaac Sim 4.5 的主要更新"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1827
msgid "Support for multiple ``TiledCamera`` instances and varying resolutions"
msgstr "支持多个 ``TiledCamera`` 实例及不同分辨率"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1828
msgid "Improved rendering performance by up to 1.2x"
msgstr "渲染性能最高提升至原来的 1.2 倍"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1829
msgid ""
"Faster startup time through optimizations in the Cloner class that improves "
"startup time by 30%"
msgstr "优化 Cloner 类，使启动时间缩短 30%"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1830
msgid ""
"Enhanced OmniPVD for debugging physics simulation, enabling capturing "
"reinforcement learning simulation"
msgstr "增强用于物理仿真调试的 OmniPVD，支持采集强化学习仿真数据"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1831
msgid ""
"Physics simulation performance optimizations improving throughput of up to "
"70%"
msgstr "优化物理仿真性能，吞吐量最高提升 70%"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1832
msgid ""
"Physics support for dedicated cylinder and cone geometry designed for robot "
"wheels that is fully GPU accelerated"
msgstr "物理引擎支持专为机器人轮子设计的圆柱和圆锥几何体，并提供完整的 GPU 加速"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1833
msgid ""
"A new physics GPU filtering mechanism allowing co-location of reinforcement "
"learning environments at the origin with minimal performance loss for scenes"
" with limited collider counts"
msgstr "新增 GPU 物理碰撞过滤机制；对于碰撞体较少的场景，可将多个强化学习环境放置在同一原点，且性能损失很小"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1835
msgid ""
"Improvements in simulation stability for mimic joints at high joint gains"
msgstr "提高耦合关节在高增益下的仿真稳定性"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1840
msgid "Adds humanoid AMP tasks for direct workflow by @Toni-SM"
msgstr "为直接工作流新增人形机器人 AMP 任务（@Toni-SM）。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1841
msgid ""
"Adds Isaac Lab Mimic based on MimicGen data generation for Imitation "
"Learning by @peterd-NV @nvcyc @ashwinvkNV @karsten-nvidia"
msgstr ""
"新增 Isaac Lab Mimic，基于 MimicGen 生成模仿学习数据（@peterd-NV @nvcyc @ashwinvkNV "
"@karsten-nvidia）。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1842
msgid ""
"Adds consolidated demo script for showcasing recording and mimic dataset "
"generation in real-time in one simulation script by @nvcyc"
msgstr "新增整合示例脚本，在同一次仿真中演示数据录制和实时 Mimic 数据集生成（@nvcyc）。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1843
msgid "Adds Franka stacking environment for GR00T mimic by @peterd-NV @nvcyc"
msgstr "新增用于 GR00T Mimic 的 Franka 堆叠环境（@peterd-NV @nvcyc）。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1844
msgid "Adds option to filter collisions and real-time playback by @kellyguo11"
msgstr "新增碰撞过滤和实时回放选项（@kellyguo11）。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1849
msgid ""
"Adds a tutorial for policy inference in a prebuilt USD scene by @oahmednv"
msgstr "新增在预先构建的 USD 场景中执行策略推理的教程（@oahmednv）。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1850
msgid "Adds unit tests for multi-tiled cameras by @matthewtrepte"
msgstr "新增多平铺相机的单元测试（@matthewtrepte）。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1851
msgid "Updates render setting defaults for better quality by @kellyguo11"
msgstr "更新默认渲染设置以改善画质（@kellyguo11）。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1852
msgid ""
"Adds a flag to wait for texture loading completion when reset by @oahmednv"
msgstr "新增标志，可在重置时等待纹理加载完成（@oahmednv）。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1853
msgid ""
"Adds pre-trained checkpoints and tools for generating and uploading "
"checkpoints by @nv-cupright"
msgstr "新增预训练检查点，以及生成和上传检查点的工具（@nv-cupright）。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1854
msgid "Adds new denoiser optimization flags for rendering by @kellyguo11"
msgstr "新增渲染降噪器的优化标志（@kellyguo11）。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1855
msgid "Updates torch to 2.5.1 by @kellyguo11"
msgstr "将 torch 升级至 2.5.1（@kellyguo11）。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1860
msgid ""
"Fixes external force buffers to set to zero when no forces/torques are "
"applied by @matthewtrepte"
msgstr "修复未施加力或力矩时外力缓冲区未清零的问题（@matthewtrepte）。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1861
msgid ""
"Fixes RSL-RL package name in ``setup.py`` according to PyPI installation by "
"@samibouziri"
msgstr "根据 PyPI 安装要求修正 ``setup.py`` 中的 RSL-RL 包名（@samibouziri）。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1866
msgid "Updates the URDF and MJCF importers for Isaac Sim 4.5 by @Dhoeller19"
msgstr "更新 URDF 和 MJCF 导入器以适配 Isaac Sim 4.5（@Dhoeller19）。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1867
msgid "Renames Isaac Lab extensions and folders by @kellyguo11"
msgstr "重命名 Isaac Lab 扩展和目录（@kellyguo11）。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1868
msgid ""
"Restructures extension folders and removes old imitation learning scripts by"
" @kellyguo11"
msgstr "调整扩展目录结构并移除旧的模仿学习脚本（@kellyguo11）。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1869
msgid ""
"Renames default conda and venv Python environment from ``isaaclab`` to "
"``env_isaaclab`` by @Toni-SM"
msgstr ""
"将默认 conda 和 venv Python 环境名从 ``isaaclab`` 改为 ``env_isaaclab`` （@Toni-SM）。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1873
msgid ""
"We have identified a breaking feature for semantic segmentation and instance"
" segmentation when using ``Camera`` and ``TiledCamera`` with instanceable "
"assets. Since the Isaac Sim 4.5 / Isaac Lab 2.0 release, semantic and "
"instance segmentation outputs only render the first tile correctly and "
"produces blank outputs for the remaining tiles. We will be introducing a "
"workaround for this fix to remove scene instancing if semantic segmentation "
"or instance segmentation is required for ``Camera`` and ``TiledCamera`` "
"until we receive a proper fix from Omniverse as part of the next Isaac Sim "
"release."
msgstr ""
"我们发现， ``Camera`` 和 ``TiledCamera`` 对可实例化资产的语义分割和实例分割存在功能异常。自 Isaac Sim 4.5 /"
" Isaac Lab 2.0 起，这两类分割输出只有第一个图块能正确渲染，其余图块为空。在 Omniverse 随下一版 Isaac Sim "
"提供正式修复前，我们将提供临时方案：当 ``Camera`` 或 ``TiledCamera`` 需要语义分割或实例分割时，禁用场景实例化。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1883
msgid "Renaming of Isaac Sim Extensions"
msgstr "重命名 Isaac Sim 扩展"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1885
msgid ""
"Previously, Isaac Sim extensions have been following the convention of "
"``omni.isaac.*``, such as ``omni.isaac.core``. In Isaac Sim 4.5, Isaac Sim "
"extensions have been renamed to use the prefix ``isaacsim``, replacing "
"``omni.isaac``. In addition, many extensions have been renamed and split "
"into multiple extensions to prepare for a more modular framework that can be"
" customized by users through the use of app templates."
msgstr ""
"之前，Isaac Sim 扩展遵循 ``omni.isaac.*`` 的约定，例如 ``omni.isaac.core`` 。在 Isaac Sim "
"4.5 中，Isaac Sim 扩展已被重命名为使用前缀 ``isaacsim`` ，替代 ``omni.isaac`` "
"。此外，许多扩展已被重命名并拆分成多个扩展，以便为更具模块化的框架做准备，用户可以通过使用应用模板进行定制。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1891
msgid ""
"Notably, the following commonly used Isaac Sim extensions in Isaac Lab are "
"renamed as follow:"
msgstr "Isaac Lab 中常用的以下 Isaac Sim 扩展已重命名："

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1893
msgid "``omni.isaac.cloner`` --> :mod:`isaacsim.core.cloner`"
msgstr "``omni.isaac.cloner`` --> :mod:`isaacsim.core.cloner`"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1894
msgid "``omni.isaac.core.prims`` --> :mod:`isaacsim.core.prims`"
msgstr "``omni.isaac.core.prims`` --> :mod:`isaacsim.core.prims`"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1895
msgid ""
"``omni.isaac.core.simulation_context`` --> "
":mod:`isaacsim.core.api.simulation_context`"
msgstr ""
"``omni.isaac.core.simulation_context`` --> "
":mod:`isaacsim.core.api.simulation_context`"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1896
msgid "``omni.isaac.core.utils`` --> :mod:`isaacsim.core.utils`"
msgstr "``omni.isaac.core.utils`` --> :mod:`isaacsim.core.utils`"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1897
msgid "``omni.isaac.core.world`` --> :mod:`isaacsim.core.api.world`"
msgstr "``omni.isaac.core.world`` --> :mod:`isaacsim.core.api.world`"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1898
msgid "``omni.isaac.kit.SimulationApp`` --> :mod:`isaacsim.SimulationApp`"
msgstr "``omni.isaac.kit.SimulationApp`` --> :mod:`isaacsim.SimulationApp`"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1899
msgid "``omni.isaac.ui`` --> :mod:`isaacsim.gui.components`"
msgstr "``omni.isaac.ui`` --> :mod:`isaacsim.gui.components`"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1902
msgid "Renaming of the URDF and MJCF Importers"
msgstr "重命名 URDF 和 MJCF 导入器"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1904
msgid ""
"Starting from Isaac Sim 4.5, the URDF and MJCF importers have been renamed "
"to be more consistent with the other extensions in Isaac Sim. The importers "
"are available on isaac-sim GitHub as open source projects."
msgstr ""
"从 Isaac Sim 4.5 开始，URDF 和 MJCF 导入器已被重命名，以便与 Isaac Sim "
"中的其他扩展保持一致。导入器作为开源项目可以在 isaac-sim GitHub 上找到。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1908
msgid ""
"Due to the extension name change, the Python module names have also been "
"changed:"
msgstr "由于扩展名更改，Python 模块名称也已更改: "

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1910
msgid ""
"URDF Importer: :mod:`isaacsim.asset.importer.urdf` (previously "
":mod:`omni.importer.urdf`)"
msgstr ""
"URDF 导入器: :mod:`isaacsim.asset.importer.urdf` （之前是 :mod:`omni.importer.urdf`"
" ）"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1911
msgid ""
"MJCF Importer: :mod:`isaacsim.asset.importer.mjcf` (previously "
":mod:`omni.importer.mjcf`)"
msgstr ""
"MJCF 导入器: :mod:`isaacsim.asset.importer.mjcf` （之前是::mod:`omni.importer.mjcf`"
" ）"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1913
msgid ""
"From the Isaac Sim UI, both URDF and MJCF importers can now be accessed "
"directly from the File > Import menu when selecting a corresponding .urdf or"
" .xml file in the file browser."
msgstr ""
"从 Isaac Sim UI 中，URDF 和 MJCF 导入器现在可以通过文件 > 导入菜单直接访问，当在文件浏览器中选择相应的 .urdf 或 "
".xml 文件时。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1917
msgid "Changes in URDF Importer"
msgstr "URDF 导入器的变化"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1919
msgid ""
"Isaac Sim 4.5 brings some updates to the URDF Importer, with a fresh UI to "
"allow for better configurations when importing robots from URDF. As a "
"result, the Isaac Lab URDF Converter has also been updated to reflect these "
"changes. The :class:`isaaclab.sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg` includes some"
" new settings, such as "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.converters.JointDriveCfg.PDGainsCfg` and "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.converters.JointDriveCfg.NaturalFrequencyGainsCfg` "
"classes for configuring the gains of the drives."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Sim 4.5 更新了 URDF 导入器，新的界面便于配置机器人的 URDF 导入选项。Isaac Lab 的 URDF "
"转换器也作了相应更新。 :class:`isaaclab.sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg` 新增了一些设置，例如可通过 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.converters.JointDriveCfg.PDGainsCfg` 和 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.converters.JointDriveCfg.NaturalFrequencyGainsCfg` "
"配置关节驱动器的增益。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1926
msgid ""
"One breaking change to note is that the "
":attr:`~isaaclab.sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.JointDriveCfg.gains` "
"attribute must be of class type "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.converters.JointDriveCfg.PDGainsCfg` or "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.converters.JointDriveCfg.NaturalFrequencyGainsCfg`."
msgstr ""
"需要注意一项破坏性变更： "
":attr:`~isaaclab.sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.JointDriveCfg.gains` 必须是 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.converters.JointDriveCfg.PDGainsCfg` 或 "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.converters.JointDriveCfg.NaturalFrequencyGainsCfg` 类型。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1930
msgid ""
"The stiffness of the "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.converters.JointDriveCfg.PDGainsCfg` must be "
"specified, as such:"
msgstr ""
"必须为 :class:`~isaaclab.sim.converters.JointDriveCfg.PDGainsCfg` 指定刚度，例如："

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1939
msgid ""
"The "
":attr:`~isaaclab.sim.converters.JointDriveCfg.NaturalFrequencyGainsCfg.natural_frequency`"
" attribute must be specified for "
":class:`~isaaclab.sim.converters.JointDriveCfg.NaturalFrequencyGainsCfg`."
msgstr ""
"必须为 :class:`~isaaclab.sim.converters.JointDriveCfg.NaturalFrequencyGainsCfg`"
" 指定 "
":attr:`~isaaclab.sim.converters.JointDriveCfg.NaturalFrequencyGainsCfg.natural_frequency`"
" 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1944
msgid "Renaming of Isaac Lab Extensions and Folders"
msgstr "重命名 Isaac Lab 扩展和文件夹"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1946
msgid ""
"Corresponding to Isaac Sim 4.5 changes, we have also made some updates to "
"the Isaac Lab directories and extensions. All extensions that were "
"previously under ``source/extensions`` are now under the ``source/`` "
"directory directly. The ``source/apps`` and ``source/standalone`` folders "
"have been moved to the root directory and are now called ``apps/`` and "
"``scripts/``."
msgstr ""
"对应于 Isaac Sim 4.5 的更改，我们也对 Isaac Lab 目录和扩展做了一些更新。所有之前位于 "
"``source/extensions`` 下的扩展现在直接位于 ``source/`` 目录下。 ``source/apps`` 和 "
"``source/standalone`` 文件夹已被移动到根目录，并且现在分别称为 ``apps/`` 和 ``scripts/`` 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1951
msgid "Isaac Lab extensions have been renamed to:"
msgstr "Isaac Lab 扩展已重命名为:"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1953
msgid "``omni.isaac.lab`` --> :mod:`isaaclab`"
msgstr "``omni.isaac.lab`` --> :mod:`isaaclab`"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1954
msgid "``omni.isaac.lab_assets`` --> :mod:`isaaclab_assets`"
msgstr "``omni.isaac.lab_assets`` --> :mod:`isaaclab_assets`"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1955
msgid "``omni.isaac.lab_tasks`` --> :mod:`isaaclab_tasks`"
msgstr "``omni.isaac.lab_tasks`` --> :mod:`isaaclab_tasks`"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1957
msgid ""
"In addition, we have split up the previous ``source/standalone/workflows`` "
"directory into ``scripts/imitation_learning`` and "
"``scripts/reinforcement_learning`` directories. The RSL RL, Stable-"
"Baselines, RL_Games, SKRL, and Ray directories are under "
"``scripts/reinforcement_learning``, while Robomimic and the new Isaac Lab "
"Mimic directories are under ``scripts/imitation_learning``."
msgstr ""
"此外，我们已将之前的 ``source/standalone/workflows`` 目录拆分为 "
"``scripts/imitation_learning`` 和 ``scripts/reinforcement_learning`` 目录。RSL "
"RL、Stable-Baselines、RL_Games、SKRL 和 Ray 目录位于 "
"``scripts/reinforcement_learning`` 下，而 Robomimic 和新的 Isaac Lab Mimic 目录则位于 "
"``scripts/imitation_learning`` 下。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1962
msgid ""
"To assist with the renaming of Isaac Lab extensions in your project, we have"
" provided a `simple script "
"<https://gist.github.com/kellyguo11/3e8f73f739b1c013b1069ad372277a85>`_ that"
" will traverse through the ``source`` and ``docs`` directories in your local"
" Isaac Lab project and replace any instance of the renamed directories and "
"imports. **Please use the script at your own risk as it will overwrite "
"source files directly.**"
msgstr ""
"为便于在项目中重命名 Isaac Lab 扩展，我们提供了一个 `简单脚本 "
"<https://gist.github.com/kellyguo11/3e8f73f739b1c013b1069ad372277a85>`_ "
"。它会遍历本地 Isaac Lab 项目的 ``source`` 和 ``docs`` 目录，替换旧目录名和导入路径。 "
"**该脚本会直接覆盖源文件，请自行评估风险后使用。**"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1969
msgid "Restructuring of Isaac Lab Extensions"
msgstr "Isaac Lab 扩展的重构"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1971
msgid ""
"With the introduction of :mod:`isaaclab_mimic`, designed for supporting data"
" generation workflows for imitation learning, we have also split out the "
"previous ``wrappers`` folder under ``isaaclab_tasks`` to its own module, "
"named :mod:`isaaclab_rl`. This new extension will contain reinforcement "
"learning specific wrappers for the various RL libraries supported by Isaac "
"Lab."
msgstr ""
"随着用于模仿学习数据生成的 :mod:`isaaclab_mimic` 加入，我们将原先 ``isaaclab_tasks`` 下的 "
"``wrappers`` 目录拆分为独立模块 :mod:`isaaclab_rl` 。这个新扩展包含 Isaac Lab "
"所支持各类强化学习库的专用封装。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1975
msgid ""
"The new :mod:`isaaclab_mimic` extension will also replace the previous "
"imitation learning scripts under the ``robomimic`` folder. We have removed "
"the old scripts for data collection and dataset preparation in favor of the "
"new mimic workflow. For users who prefer to use the previous scripts, they "
"will be available in previous release branches."
msgstr ""
"新的 :mod:`isaaclab_mimic` 扩展也取代了 ``robomimic`` "
"目录下原有的模仿学习脚本。旧的数据采集和数据集准备脚本已移除，改用新的 Mimic 工作流。需要继续使用旧脚本的用户，可从此前的发布分支获取。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:1979
msgid ""
"Additionally, we have also restructured the :mod:`isaaclab_assets` extension"
" to be split into ``robots`` and ``sensors`` subdirectories. This allows for"
" clearer separation between the pre-defined configurations provided in the "
"extension."
msgstr ""
"此外， :mod:`isaaclab_assets` 扩展也拆分为 ``robots`` 和 ``sensors`` "
"子目录，使各类预定义配置的组织更清晰。"

