#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2050
msgid ""
"Due to a great amount of amazing updates, we are putting out one more Isaac "
"Lab release based off of Isaac Sim 4.2. This release contains many great new"
" additions and bug fixes, including several new environments, distributed "
"training and hyperparameter support with Ray, new live plot feature for "
"Manager-based environments, and more."
msgstr ""
"由于新增了许多功能，我们又发布了一个基于 Isaac Sim 4.2 的 Isaac Lab 版本。本版本包含多个新环境、基于 Ray "
"的分布式训练与超参数支持、管理器环境的实时绘图等功能，以及多项问题修复。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2054
msgid ""
"We will now spend more focus on the next Isaac Lab release geared towards "
"the new Isaac Sim 4.5 release coming soon. The upcoming release will contain"
