msgid "Setting the simulation device into the simulation context"
msgstr "在仿真上下文中设置仿真设备"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2274
msgid ""
"Previously, changing the simulation device to CPU required users to set "
"other simulation parameters (such as disabling GPU physics and GPU "
"pipelines). This made setting up the device appear complex. We now simplify "
"the checks for device directly inside the simulation context, so users only "
"need to specify the device through the configuration object."
msgstr ""
"此前，将仿真设备改为 CPU 时，还需设置其他仿真参数，例如禁用 GPU 物理仿真和 GPU "
"流水线，配置过程较为繁琐。现在，设备检查直接在仿真上下文中完成，用户只需通过配置对象指定设备。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2279 source/refs/release_notes.rst:2305
#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2344 source/refs/release_notes.rst:2390
msgid "Before:"
msgstr "此前："

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2285 source/refs/release_notes.rst:2321
#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2360 source/refs/release_notes.rst:2397
msgid "Now:"
msgstr "现在："

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2292
msgid "Setting the simulation device from CLI"
msgstr "通过命令行设置仿真设备"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2294
msgid ""
"Previously, users could specify the device through the command line argument"
" ``--device_id``. However, this made it ambiguous when users wanted to set "
"the device to CPU. Thus, instead of the device ID, users need to specify the"
" device explicitly through the argument ``--device``. The valid options for "
"the device name are:"
msgstr ""
"此前，用户通过命令行参数 ``--device_id`` 指定设备，但这种方式无法明确表达使用 CPU 的意图。因此，现在需要通过 "
"``--device`` 明确指定设备，而非仅提供设备 ID。有效的设备名称如下："

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2299
msgid "\"cpu\": runs simulation on CPU"
msgstr "\"cpu\"：在 CPU 上运行仿真"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2300
msgid "\"cuda\": runs simulation on GPU with device ID at default index"
msgstr "\"cuda\"：在默认索引对应的 GPU 上运行仿真"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2301
msgid ""
"\"cuda:N\": runs simulation on GPU with device ID at ``N``. For instance, "
"\"cuda:0\" will use device at index \"0\"."
msgstr "\"cuda:N\"：在设备 ID 为 ``N`` 的 GPU 上运行仿真。例如，\"cuda:0\" 使用索引为 \"0\" 的设备。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2303
msgid ""
"Due to the above change, the command line interaction with some of the "
"scripts has changed."
msgstr "上述改动也改变了部分脚本的命令行用法。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:0
msgid "uv (Recommended)"
msgstr "uv（推荐）"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:0
msgid "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"
msgstr "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2338
msgid "Renaming of teleoperation device CLI in standalone scripts"
msgstr "重命名独立脚本的遥操作设备命令行参数"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2340
msgid ""
"Since ``--device`` is now an argument provided by the AppLauncher, it "
"conflicted with the command-line argument used for specifying the "
"teleoperation-device in some of the standalone scripts. Thus, to fix this "
"conflict, the teleoperation-device now needs to be specified through "
"``--teleop_device`` argument."
msgstr ""
"由于 AppLauncher 现在提供 ``--device`` "
"参数，它与部分独立脚本中指定遥操作设备的同名参数发生冲突。为解决这一问题，遥操作设备改由 ``--teleop_device`` 参数指定。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2379
msgid "Using Python-version of container utility script"
msgstr "使用 Python 版本的容器工具脚本"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2381
msgid ""
"The prior `container.sh <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/blob/v1.1.0/docker/container.sh>`_ became quite complex as it "
"had many different use cases in one script. For instance, building a docker "
"image for \"base\" or \"ros2\", as well as cluster deployment. As more users"
" wanted to have the flexibility to overlay their own docker settings, "
"maintaining this bash script became cumbersome. Hence, we migrated its "
"features into a Python script in this release. Additionally, we split the "
"cluster-related utilities into their own script inside the "
"``docker/cluster`` directory."
msgstr ""
"原先的 `container.sh <https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/blob/v1.1.0/docker/container.sh>`_ 在一个脚本中处理多种用途，例如构建 \"base\" 或"
" \"ros2\" Docker 镜像，以及集群部署，逐渐变得复杂。越来越多用户希望叠加自己的 Docker 配置，这也使 Bash "
"脚本难以维护。因此，本版本将其功能迁移到 Python 脚本，并将集群相关工具拆分到 ``docker/cluster`` 目录下的独立脚本中。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2387
msgid ""
"We still maintain backward compatibility for ``container.sh``. Internally, "
"it calls the Python script ``container.py``. We request users to use the "
"Python script directly."
msgstr ""
"``container.sh`` 仍保留向后兼容性，但内部会调用 Python 脚本 ``container.py`` 。建议直接使用 Python "
"脚本。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2405
msgid "Using separate directories for logging videos in RL workflows"
msgstr "强化学习工作流的视频分目录存储"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2407
msgid ""
"Previously, users could record videos during the RL training by specifying "
"the ``--video`` flag to the ``train.py`` script. The videos would be saved "
"inside the ``videos`` directory in the corresponding log directory of the "
"run."
msgstr ""
"此前，用户可向 ``train.py`` 传入 ``--video`` 标志，在强化学习训练期间录制视频。视频保存在本次运行日志目录下的 "
"``videos`` 目录中。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2411
msgid ""
"Since many users requested to also be able to record videos while "
"inferencing the policy, recording videos have also been added to the "
"``play.py`` script. Since changing the prefix of the video file names is not"
" possible, the videos from the train and play scripts are saved inside the "
"``videos/train`` and ``videos/play`` directories, respectively."
msgstr ""
"应用户要求， ``play.py`` 也新增了策略推理时的视频录制功能。由于无法更改视频文件名的前缀，train 和 play 脚本录制的视频分别保存到"
" ``videos/train`` 和 ``videos/play`` 目录中。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2417
msgid "Drops support for the tiled camera with Isaac Sim 4.1"
msgstr "不再支持在 Isaac Sim 4.1 中使用平铺相机"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2419
msgid ""
"Various fixes have been made to the tiled camera rendering pipeline in Isaac"
" Sim 4.2. This made supporting the tiled camera with Isaac Sim 4.1 "
"difficult. Hence, for the best experience, we advice switching to Isaac Sim "
"4.2 with this release of Isaac Lab."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Sim 4.2 修复了平铺相机渲染流水线中的多项问题，使继续支持 Isaac Sim 4.1 的平铺相机变得困难。因此，建议本版本 "
"Isaac Lab 配合 Isaac Sim 4.2 使用，以获得最佳体验。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2425
msgid "v1.1.0"
msgstr "v1.1.0"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2430
msgid ""
"With the release of Isaac Sim 4.0 and 4.1, support for Isaac Sim 2023.1.1 "
"has been discontinued. We strongly encourage all users to upgrade to Isaac "
"Sim 4.1 to take advantage of the latest features and improvements. For "
"detailed information on this upgrade, please refer to the release notes "
"available `here "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/overview/release_notes.html#>`__."
msgstr ""
"随着 Isaac Sim 4.0 和 4.1 发布，我们不再支持 Isaac Sim 2023.1.1。建议所有用户升级到 Isaac Sim "
"4.1，以使用最新功能和改进。升级详情请参阅 `发布说明 "
"<https://docs.isaacsim.omniverse.nvidia.com/latest/overview/release_notes.html#>`__"
" 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2435
msgid ""
"Besides the above, the Isaac Lab release brings new features and "
"improvements, as detailed below. We thank all our contributors for their "
"continued support."
msgstr "此外，本次 Isaac Lab 发布也带来了下文所列的新功能和改进。感谢所有贡献者的持续支持。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2438
msgid ""
"**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/compare/v1.0.0...v1.1.0"
msgstr ""
"**完整变更记录** ：https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab/compare/v1.0.0...v1.1.0"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2443
