#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2476
msgid "Removes the use of body view inside the asset classes by @Mayankm96"
msgstr "移除资产类内部对 body view 的使用（@Mayankm96）。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2477
msgid ""
"Renames ``SimulationCfg.substeps`` to ``SimulationCfg.render_interval`` by "
"@Dhoeller19"
msgstr ""
"将 ``SimulationCfg.substeps`` 重命名为 ``SimulationCfg.render_interval`` "
"（@Dhoeller19）。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2483
msgid "Renaming of ``SimulationCfg.substeps``"
msgstr "重命名 ``SimulationCfg.substeps``"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2485
msgid ""
"Previously, the users set both ``omni.isaac.lab.sim.SimulationCfg.dt`` and "
"``omni.isaac.lab.sim.SimulationCfg.substeps``, which marked the physics "
"insulation time-step and sub-steps, respectively. It was unclear whether "
"sub-steps meant the number of integration steps inside the physics time-step"
" ``dt`` or the number of physics steps inside a rendering step."
msgstr ""
"此前，用户设置的 ``omni.isaac.lab.sim.SimulationCfg.dt`` 和 "
"``omni.isaac.lab.sim.SimulationCfg.substeps`` "
"分别表示物理仿真时间步长和子步数。但“子步”含义不够明确：它可能指一个物理时间步 ``dt`` 内的积分步数，也可能指一个渲染步内的物理仿真步数。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2490
msgid ""
"Since in the code base, the attribute was used as the latter, it has been "
"renamed to ``render_interval`` for clarity."
msgstr "由于代码中该属性表示后者，因此将其重命名为 ``render_interval`` ，以明确其含义。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2493
msgid "Removal of Deprecated Attributes"
msgstr "移除已弃用的属性"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2495
msgid ""
"As notified in previous releases, we removed the classes and attributes "
"marked as deprecated. These are as follows:"
msgstr "按照此前版本的弃用通知，我们移除了下列类和属性："

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2497
msgid ""
"The ``mdp.add_body_mass`` method in the events. Please use the "
"``mdp.randomize_rigid_body_mass`` instead."
msgstr "事件中的 ``mdp.add_body_mass`` 方法，请改用 ``mdp.randomize_rigid_body_mass`` 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2498
msgid ""
"The classes ``managers.RandomizationManager`` and "
"``managers.RandomizationTermCfg``. Please use the ``managers.EventManager`` "
"and ``managers.EventTermCfg`` classes instead."
msgstr ""
"``managers.RandomizationManager`` 和 ``managers.RandomizationTermCfg`` 类，请改用 "
"``managers.EventManager`` 和 ``managers.EventTermCfg`` 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2500
msgid ""
"The following properties in ``omni.isaac.lab.sensors.FrameTransformerData``:"
" * ``target_rot_source`` --> ``target_quat_w`` * ``target_rot_w`` --> "
"``target_quat_source`` * ``source_rot_w`` --> ``source_quat_w``"
msgstr ""
"``omni.isaac.lab.sensors.FrameTransformerData`` 中的以下属性： "
"``target_rot_source`` → ``target_quat_w`` ； ``target_rot_w`` → "
"``target_quat_source`` ； ``source_rot_w`` → ``source_quat_w`` 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2505
msgid ""
"The attribute ``body_physx_view`` from the "
"``omni.isaac.lab.assets.Articulation`` and "
"``omni.isaac.lab.assets.RigidObject`` classes. These caused confusion when "
"used with the articulation view since the body names did not follow the same"
" ordering."
msgstr ""
"``omni.isaac.lab.assets.Articulation`` 和 "
"``omni.isaac.lab.assets.RigidObject`` 类中的 ``body_physx_view`` "
"属性。该视图的刚体名称顺序与关节体视图不同，容易造成混淆。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2510
msgid "v1.0.0"
msgstr "v1.0.0"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2515
msgid "Welcome to the first official release of Isaac Lab!"
msgstr "欢迎使用 Isaac Lab 的首个正式版本！"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2517
msgid ""
"Building upon the foundation of the `Orbit <https://isaac-"
"orbit.github.io/>`_ framework, we have integrated the RL environment "
"designing workflow from `OmniIsaacGymEnvs <https://github.com/NVIDIA-"
"Omniverse/OmniIsaacGymEnvs>`_. This allows users to choose a suitable "
":ref:`task-design approach <feature-workflows>` for their applications."
msgstr ""
"在 `Orbit <https://isaac-orbit.github.io/>`_ 框架的基础上，我们整合了 `OmniIsaacGymEnvs "
"<https://github.com/NVIDIA-Omniverse/OmniIsaacGymEnvs>`_ "
"的强化学习环境设计工作流，让用户能根据应用选择合适的 :ref:`任务设计方式 <feature-workflows>` 。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2522
msgid ""
"While we maintain backward compatibility with Isaac Sim 2023.1.1, we highly "
"recommend using Isaac Lab with Isaac Sim 4.0.0 version for the latest "
"features and improvements."
msgstr "本版本仍兼容 Isaac Sim 2023.1.1，但建议搭配 Isaac Sim 4.0.0 使用，以获得最新功能和改进。"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2525
msgid ""
"**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLab/compare/v0.3.1...v1.0.0"
msgstr ""
"**完整变更记录** ：https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLab/compare/v0.3.1...v1.0.0"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2530
msgid ""
"Integrated CI/CD pipeline, which is triggered on pull requests and publishes"
" the results publicly"
msgstr "集成 CI/CD 流水线，在提交拉取请求时触发，并公开运行结果"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2531
msgid "Extended support for Windows OS platforms"
msgstr "扩展 Windows 操作系统支持"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2532
msgid ""
"Added tiled render based Camera sensor implementation. This provides "
"optimized RGB-D rendering throughputs of up to 10k frames per second."
msgstr "新增基于平铺渲染的相机传感器实现，优化后的 RGB-D 渲染吞吐量最高可达每秒 1 万帧"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2534
msgid ""
"Added support for multi-GPU and multi-node training for the RL-Games library"
msgstr "新增 RL-Games 多 GPU 和多节点训练支持"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2535
msgid ""
"Integrated APIs for environment designing (direct workflow) without relying "
"on managers"
msgstr "集成不依赖管理器的环境设计 API（直接工作流）"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2536
msgid "Added implementation of delayed PD actuator model"
msgstr "新增带延迟的 PD 执行器模型"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2537
msgid ""
"Added various new learning environments: * Cartpole balancing using images *"
" Shadow hand cube reorientation * Boston Dynamics Spot locomotion * Unitree "
"H1 and G1 locomotion * ANYmal-C navigation * Quadcopter target reaching"
msgstr ""
"新增多种学习环境：基于图像的 Cartpole 平衡、Shadow Hand 立方体调姿、Boston Dynamics Spot 运动、Unitree"
" H1 和 G1 运动、ANYmal-C 导航，以及四旋翼目标到达任务"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2548
msgid ""
"Reduced start-up time for scripts (inherited from Isaac Sim 4.0 "
"improvements)"
msgstr "缩短脚本启动时间（得益于 Isaac Sim 4.0 的改进）"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2549
msgid ""
"Added lazy buffer implementation for rigid object and articulation data. "
"Instead of updating all the quantities at every step call, the lazy buffers "
"are updated only when the user queries them"
msgstr "为刚体对象和关节体数据新增惰性缓冲区。它们不再每步更新全部数据，而是在用户查询时才更新"

#: source/refs/release_notes.rst:2551
msgid "Added SKRL support to more environments"
msgstr "为更多环境新增 SKRL 支持"

